title: "人生进阶指南：一个普通人的失败、恢复与重新学习 / Still Here: A Field Guide to Beginning Again"
abstract: >-
  A bilingual, recovery-centred field guide to failure, depression, beginning
  again, English learning, AI-assisted practice, real work, and evidence-based
  reflection. The Chinese text is the primary edition; the English edition is an
  adapted rewrite, not a literal translation. Text: CC BY-NC 4.0. Code: MIT.
